{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/compare/master...6889947c9f71d10114c3db9eb8b3acb8e5e749af","html_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/compare/master...6889947c9f71d10114c3db9eb8b3acb8e5e749af","permalink_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/compare/ArtifexSoftware:852bc74...ArtifexSoftware:6889947","diff_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/compare/master...6889947c9f71d10114c3db9eb8b3acb8e5e749af.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/compare/master...6889947c9f71d10114c3db9eb8b3acb8e5e749af.patch","base_commit":{"sha":"852bc7460995ac285eeddef6a536ce158a711227","node_id":"C_kwDOD5mCPNoAKDg1MmJjNzQ2MDk5NWFjMjg1ZWVkZGVmNmE1MzZjZTE1OGE3MTEyMjc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Ken Sharp","email":"Ken.Sharp@artifex.com","date":"2026-11-11T15:18:26Z"},"committer":{"name":"Ken Sharp","email":"Ken.Sharp@artifex.com","date":"2026-11-11T15:18:52Z"},"message":"pdfwrite - Check indirect references to Actions for Launch actions\n\nBug #709818 \"pdfwrite PDF/A conversion skips Launch checks for indirect action dictionaries\"\n\nThe way that the PDF interpreter and pdfwrite interact here makes things\nquite difficult. We turn the original indirect refrence to the Action\ndictionary into a dictionary, and an indirect reference to it, back in\nthe PDF interpreter.\n\nThis preserves the original sense, but the way we do this, because of\npdfmark syntax is ludicrous. We end up creating a unique label,\nthen creating the Action dictionary as a local named object using that\nlabel. Then we refer to the named object from the Link annotation.\n\nSo to check an indirect object we need to reverse all that; we need to\nfind a given object number in the local (and potentially global)\nnamed object dictionary, then check that the object is a dictionary and\nfinally see if it has a /S key and a /Launch value.","tree":{"sha":"716de901e8a6309a8146f7b895729312a17ec359","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/git/trees/716de901e8a6309a8146f7b895729312a17ec359"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/git/commits/852bc7460995ac285eeddef6a536ce158a711227","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commits/852bc7460995ac285eeddef6a536ce158a711227","html_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commit/852bc7460995ac285eeddef6a536ce158a711227","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commits/852bc7460995ac285eeddef6a536ce158a711227/comments","author":null,"committer":null,"parents":[{"sha":"9637d0d71bb78344efe654345103da4f4dd964cb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commits/9637d0d71bb78344efe654345103da4f4dd964cb","html_url":"https://github.com/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commit/9637d0d71bb78344efe654345103da4f4dd964cb"}]},"merge_base_commit":{"sha":"6889947c9f71d10114c3db9eb8b3acb8e5e749af","node_id":"C_kwDOD5mCPNoAKDY4ODk5NDdjOWY3MWQxMDExNGMzZGI5ZWI4YjNhY2I4ZTVlNzQ5YWY","commit":{"author":{"name":"Chris Liddell","email":"chris.liddell@artifex.com","date":"2026-03-24T13:15:04Z"},"committer":{"name":"Chris Liddell","email":"chris.liddell@artifex.com","date":"2026-05-22T07:04:31Z"},"message":"Bug 709271: cups - add a bounds check and value clamp\n\nThese address issues 1 and 5 from the bug.","tree":{"sha":"0016bd3a0253cd1c5c3d71c1be8ecf16925ce8ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/git/trees/0016bd3a0253cd1c5c3d71c1be8ecf16925ce8ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/git/commits/6889947c9f71d10114c3db9eb8b3acb8e5e749af","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":false,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"payload":null,"verified_at":null}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ArtifexSoftware/ghostpdl/commits/6889947c9f71d10114c3db9eb8b3acb8e5e749af","html_url":"https://github.com/Ar